# Round eb, 5D canary: the four workloads once each on the GPU path before the matrix (the legal
# five-city baseline: 40 buildings per city, 2000 t of test goods, a 1920 x 1080 view at group 2,
# paced at 60 Hz, two picture and two chunk workers, the interactive window's upload limits).
c-idle      --scenario idle --duration-s 5 --goods-tons 2000 --gpu 1
c-one       --scenario one --goods-tons 2000 --gpu 1
c-burst     --scenario burst --edits 50 --goods-tons 2000 --gpu 1
c-sustained --scenario stream --rate 10 --edits 100 --goods-tons 2000 --gpu 1
